{"type":"text","timestamp":1794536195160,"sessionID":"ses_e2d54b64cffeArt4MwJatqOJX4","part":{"id":"prt_1d2b12d7d001iO42K4QG4dxSVf","sessionID":"ses_e2d54b64cffeArt4MwJatqOJX4","messageID":"msg_1d2b1285a001EPE0FjU8hQfAPi","type":"text","text":"T028 complete.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs` (only file touched)\n\n**What was added**\n- A target-pinned `skillAdvisorRoute(target)` lookup, with the existing tune helper refactored onto it.\n- Embedder constants plus `embedderRoute()`, `embedderWorkflow()`, `yamlStrings()` and `phaseText()` helpers.\n- Four new cases:\n  1. The embedder route is in `_routes.yaml` exactly once, with its YAML asset, `execution_mode`/`dry_run` setup vars, `--dry-run`, `mutates`, advisor database plus Ollama model store in `gate3_location`, the status and scan CLI commands, and three or more three-word trigger phrases.\n  2. The workflow's phases are in probe, plan, approval, approved steps, scan, verify order and every `runs_when` phase sits after `phase_3_approval`, with `ollama pull`, `ollama serve` and `skill_graph_scan` only in gated phases.\n  3. `--dry-run` stops after the plan with `STATUS=OK`, before the first gated phase, and changes nothing.\n  4. No step installs Ollama: the NEVER rule, the print-only forbidden target, and every install mention limited to a print instruction with no install command.\n\n**Verify output** — `node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs`\n\n```\n✔ every advisor command declared on the skill-advisor route exists in the live registry (subset, not equality) (12.513625ms)\n✔ the registry reader ignores name fields outside the exported tool list (0.407334ms)\n✔ the researched high-value command subset is declared on the skill-advisor route, including skill_graph_validate (5.641667ms)\n✔ each declared invocation keeps the flags its command needs (5.448292ms)\n✔ the doctor command docs and workflow assets reach the advisor through the CLI and name no advisor MCP tool id (7.474833ms)\n✔ the allowed-tools reader finds the first listed tool and the YAML list form (0.173667ms)\n✔ the route does not silently claim full-registry equality — this stays a documented subset (4.589ms)\n✔ the embedder setup route is in the manifest with its own workflow asset and dry run (4.409708ms)\n✔ the embedder workflow stops at one approval before any pull, server start or scan (5.357791ms)\n✔ a dry run stops after the plan with STATUS=OK and changes nothing (7.283333ms)\n✔ no embedder step installs Ollama, which the route only prints for the operator (5.994792ms)\nℹ tests 11\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 11\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 61.977208\nEXIT=0\n```\n\n**Not done / notes**\n- The tasks.md checkbox was not ticked, per instruction.\n- No commit, push, or git state change.\n- `node --check` passes and the file contains no spec ids. The new test names and comments use no em dashes or semicolons in comment prose.\n- `plan.md` was not needed; the task line did not point at it.","time":{"start":1794536189309,"end":1794536195160}}}
